{"steam_appid":3712080,"steam_name":"Funnel Runners","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3712080/1226337058/5524b0b9c91c913f746f6d67808398ca90494157/1780357097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780357936","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292724/997f0fe2525d01b7f445853a8850d2597da11292/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780357936","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/1e5314f3a1fbbf57d80b738207d69e6e334bd520/ss_1e5314f3a1fbbf57d80b738207d69e6e334bd520.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784567934","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/19596470f2f0d7543364662578381ae48f6b5083/ss_19596470f2f0d7543364662578381ae48f6b5083.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784567934","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/e35b2d091d86efcbb19c04d309b8603e43660863/ss_e35b2d091d86efcbb19c04d309b8603e43660863.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784567934","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/85c60d6dec890e49ae87affd4cb9aaa513cc3e6f/ss_85c60d6dec890e49ae87affd4cb9aaa513cc3e6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784567934","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/ba2ed35478ce20106fc5b0bd4a2ecb5f4cbbd95c/ss_ba2ed35478ce20106fc5b0bd4a2ecb5f4cbbd95c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784567934"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.poster.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.webm?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.mp4?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Funnel Runners</strong>, where you will have your first on-site deployment with APEX Storm Monitoring Services. <br><br>A high-priority F5 tornado is approaching, and we are counting on <strong>you (and up to 7 fellow friends)</strong> to <strong>collect data, scavenge necessary information</strong>, and, of course, <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/06dcb0607fcde2708e741762632b798b.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1784567934\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.poster.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.webm?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.mp4?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The weather is your worst enemy here. <strong>Tornados and storms will spawn randomly</strong>, <strong>grow stronger</strong> over time, and <strong>tear the whole map apart</strong>. Buildings will collapse piece by piece, and items will no longer be found in destroyed areas, so you must adapt quickly.  <strong>Be careful not to be swept up by the wind; you may not be found again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1784567934\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.poster.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.webm?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.mp4?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this mission, you can <strong>team up with 7 other players or tackle it solo</strong>. <strong>Share gadgets, split up</strong> to cover more ground, <strong>collect necessary information and items</strong> to <strong>fix the van</strong> before the situation turns bad. <br><br>With <strong>realistic graphics and a first-person perspective</strong>, the experience brings you close to every gust of wind, distant siren, and falling piece of debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1784567934\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.poster.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.webm?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.mp4?t=1784567934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge the collapsing city for scattered <strong>vehicle parts, fuel, and tools</strong>. These items will allow you to <strong>repair your van and help you survive the storm</strong>. Each playthrough features <strong>randomized environments, weather, items, and problems to solve on your vehicle</strong>. No playthrough will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1784567934\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/2d9ada22e06ded7538b4462ad55b68f3.avif?t=1784567934\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 / Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1070 8GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphics Preset: Favor Performance / Resolution 1080p</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 / Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 Ti / Nvidia GeForce RTX 4070 / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphics Preset: Favor Visuals / Resolution: 1440p</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Supernova Studios LLC"],"publishers":["Supernova Studios LLC"],"release_date":"16 Jul, 2026"}